83
00:03:35,230 --> 00:03:37,445
When it comes to formatting, use vertical

84
00:03:37,493 --> 00:03:40,413
formatting to keep related concepts together

85
00:03:40,766 --> 00:03:43,221
and to separate concepts which are not

86
00:03:43,269 --> 00:03:44,199
closely related.

87
00:03:44,777 --> 00:03:47,247
And when I say together or separate, I'm

88
00:03:47,279 --> 00:03:49,766
