93
00:04:00,932 --> 00:04:02,520
Now, when we talk about horizontal

94
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,830
formatting, you wanna keep lines short and

95
00:04:04,991 --> 00:04:07,397
add line breaks and split code across

96
00:04:07,397 --> 00:04:09,803
