183
00:07:44,607 --> 00:07:47,140
you're not diving too deeply into

184
00:07:47,733 --> 00:07:51,644
objects and their API and the API of only

185
00:07:51,757 --> 00:07:53,231
loosely related objects,

186
00:07:53,841 --> 00:07:55,702
which often leads to code which would be

187
00:07:55,751 --> 00:07:58,657
hard to understand and hard to maintain.

188
00:07:59,605 --> 00:08:02,480
And speaking of maintainability, especially

189
00:08:02,496 --> 00:08:04,600
when using an object-oriented programming

190
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,816
style, you should follow the SOLID

191
00:08:06,848 --> 00:08:07,378
principles.

192
00:08:08,053 --> 00:08:11,457
Now there especially the SRP and OCP matter,

193
