as I explained in the Classes and Objects

194
00:08:13,818 --> 00:08:14,171
module,

195
00:08:14,701 --> 00:08:16,645
but if you follow these principles in

196
00:08:16,645 --> 00:08:19,471
general, you also often will end up with

197
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:22,072
cleaner code automatically. Because these

198
00:08:22,104 --> 00:08:24,127
principles do not just enforce

199
00:08:24,175 --> 00:08:26,887
